A||||5||jailer||horn, dome lights, & lighter don't work||||8||
Z||000000||jailer||06-25-2001||10:01 AM||||Can someone please help me?<BR>My horn, dome lights & lighter don't work.<BR>The 20 amp fuse blows everytime I replace it.<BR>The last time I replaced it, the dome lights and lighter worked for a week, but not the horn. Then one day it just blew again. I'm sure that it's a short somewhere, but where should I look?||||reg||8
Z||000001||84Bill||06-25-2001||11:46 AM||||Unplug the lighter under the center console. chances are there is a short in it. Usually if you remove the lighter you will find a penny or dime stuck down in there. That fuse also powers the Radio station memory and clock if I'm not mistaken.||||reg||1
Z||000002||EdsB52||06-25-2001||12:08 PM||||Well then just don't smoke while you're driving in traffic at night.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Formula88||06-25-2001||12:32 PM||||Yup, they're all on the same fuse, including the radio presets.  It was the lighter in my Formula that caused it.  I just unplugged it and everything is working fine.  I may fix it one day, but the only thing I'd use it for is to charge my cell phone....||||reg||6
Z||000004||84Bill||06-25-2001||01:32 PM||||Hey I just noticed, Welcome to the Forum  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>You will be happy to know there are some really great folks from the Lancaster area here on the forum. I see your a bit of a ways away but trust me it will be worth the trip if you stop by. It's not a club, just a bunch (12) of folks the like to drive and do fun stuff. Here are some of their screen names. Skitime, Veronicas V6 GT, Fleabitdog, Fierochick88, Denny, Brucepts, Frank Sombers, Ditz88GT, and Justin all live very close to together, Im sure I missed a few.<BR> <BR>Here are some pics and videos of some of the shows I went to with theese folks.<BR> Enjoy  <A HREF="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/theshows.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/theshows.htm</A> ||||reg||14
